<title>USA: Precision gets 9-YR Tracor contract.</title>
<headline>Precision gets 9-YR Tracor contract.</headline>
<dateline>DENVER, Colo. 1997-07-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Precision Standard Inc said Thursday its Hayes Targets division received a nine-year contract from Tracor Inc for an unspecified amount.</p>
<p>Hayes will supply Tracor with tow targets, payloads and countermeasure dispensers for use by the Royal Australian Navy, Precision said.</p>
<p>A company official was not immediately available to elaborate.</p>
</text>
